t","s":"Alister Cowan","x":"Our offshore assets were able to capture 100% of this improvement, with an average price realization of $86.00 per barrel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/suncor-energy-inc-su-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2019 Q1","e":"su","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Neil Mehta","x":"…Suncor has gone through a period of rapid growth, but as some of these big projects ultimately come online, the growth flattens out, and so how can cash flow grow, which goes back to your point about ultimately driving margin expansion and cost savings, and capital savings to get that $2 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/suncor-energy-inc-su-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2019 Q2","e":"su","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Little","x":"With that, I'll pass it on to Alister, to provide some color on our second quarter financial results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/suncor-energy-inc-su-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q1","e":"su","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Little","x":"This decision is expected to contribute $200 million toward our operating cost reduction target and $100 million of our capital reduction target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/suncor-energy-inc-su-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q2","e":"su","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alister Cowan","x":"During Q2, we maximized price realization with approximately 80% of the company's upstream product mix really toward lighter crude.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/suncor-energy-su-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q2","e":"su","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alister Cowan","x":"We remain confident in the agility of our business and our people to deliver the $1 billion of operating cost savings in 2020 relative to 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/suncor-energy-su-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q2","e":"su","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alister Cowan","x":"I'd just add there, Greg, that from a cost perspective, it's not only cost reduction across the business including in the downstream, also helped them in the quarter as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/suncor-energy-su-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q3","e":"su","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Little","x":"As a result of our cost reduction initiatives, the sustaining capital and operating costs required to operate at this level remains essentially unchanged from when we were only operating one train.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/suncor-energy-su-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q3","e":"su","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Little","x":"So if you take our headcount reductions, what's the structural cost reductions we ended up getting this year, you're getting very close to our 2023 target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/suncor-energy-su-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q4","e":"su","d":"2021-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Menno Hulshof","x":"And how confident are you that on streaming of Line 3 replacement is still a year-end event?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/suncor-energy-su-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SU 2020 Q4","e":"su","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alister Cowan","x":"As we are executing on our cost reduction and productivity plans, we're driving down the cost side of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/